    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "上一段讲到「ImageNet」。现在把镜头转向「MS COCO」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：如果把「MS COCO」拆开来看，真正改变研究方向的部分是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "MS COCO 通过强调自然上下文中的物体、分割掩码、图像字幕和日常场景，改变了视觉识别基准。它在同一生态中支持检测、分割、字幕生成和关键点任务。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-microsoft-coco-common-objects-in-context"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "图像被标注物体、掩码、字幕和任务标签，使模型在更丰富的场景理解上接受评估。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-microsoft-coco-common-objects-in-context"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 MS COCO 视为现代计算机视觉最重要的数据集之一。它的长期影响在于多任务基准文化塑造了目标检测、分割和字幕生成的进展。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-microsoft-coco-common-objects-in-context"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "回看「ImageNet」，再看「MS COCO」，我们能听见同一个技术问题跨越年代后的回响。",
            "sourceIds": [
